        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3617, Simple Cabinet Bow Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simplicity of the 3 Inch Plain Bow Cabinet Pull should not deter you. Its simplistic looks, are what make it beautiful. The gentle swirling design adds a point of interest to this cabinet pull. It is available in 9 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3617 Traditional 3 Inch Plain Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
